OL,5,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FA driver disastrously misjudges an
OL,7,     Fovertaking manoeuvre, while
OL,8,     Fanother falls asleep at the wheel
OL,9,     Fon the M1 motorway.
OL,10,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,11,     FRoad crime cops Nick Lovatt and
OL,12,     FMark Scott from Derbyshire's
OL,13,     FSpecialist ANPR crime unit target
OL,14,     Fdrug dealers coming into the
OL,15,     Fcounty from other areas.
OL,16,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,17,     FObservational documentary series.
OL,18,     FThe high-speed pursuit specialists
OL,19,     Fof Cumbria tackle a runaway
OL,20,     Fknifeman, an overturned trailer
OL,21,     Ffull of cows and a ruptured gas
OL,22,     Fmain.
