OL,5,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FDuncan receives a shock when a
OL,7,     Fcyclist who has been crushed and
OL,8,     Ftrapped under a car turns out to
OL,9,     Fbe someone he knows.
OL,10,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,11,     FCumbria's interceptor teams are
OL,12,     Fcalled out to deal with a
OL,13,     Fsuspected gunman, a pedestrian
OL,14,     Funder a car and to destroy a
OL,15,     Fcannabis farm.
OL,16,G1700 Car Pound Cops
OL,17,     FOn Skye in Scotland, apprentice
OL,18,     FJordan helps a tourist with a
OL,19,     Fpunctured tyre and a family in tow
OL,20,     Fthat isn't all it seems- could the
OL,21,     Fdriver end up on the wrong side of
OL,22,     Fthe law? (S2 E1)
