OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FThe pace at Barnsley Casualty is
OL,7,     Frelentless; other hospitals in the
OL,8,     Farea are full and as a result,
OL,9,     Fambulances are being diverted to
OL,10,     FBarnsley.
OL,11,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,12,     FA pair of air ambulance teams
OL,13,     Frespond to a serious accident
OL,14,     Fwhere one passenger was thrown out
OL,15,     Fwhile the driver remains trapped.
OL,16,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,17,     FA man is rushed in to Majors
OL,18,     Fsuffering a collapsed lung as air
OL,19,     Fleaks into his chest cavity, a
OL,20,     Fhighly abusive patient must be
OL,21,     Frestrained, and a rough sleeper
OL,22,     Fcomes in with burnt feet.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
