OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FBack in Birmingham, Dr Emma and Dr
OL,7,     FDev face their biggest-ever head
OL,8,     Fcyst, Dr Adil preps a bride-to-be
OL,9,     Fby removing a large keloid, and Dr
OL,10,     FMagnus treats an unusual foot
OL,11,     Flipoma.
OL,12,G0000 999: Killer On The Line
OL,13,     FExamining the case of Darren
OL,14,     FByrne, a former city trader who
OL,15,     Fkilled his wife and then tried to
OL,16,     Fburn down the family home after
OL,17,     Fshe discovered that he was having
OL,18,     Fan affair.
